WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.366
You can bundle
translations at build time,

2
00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:06.709
load them from a CDN,
or translate on request.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.575
General Translation generates
translations before release,

4
00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:12.931
for a bundle or its CDN.

5
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.563
Run npx gt translate
before the build,

6
00:00:17.563 --> 00:00:20.000
and a bundle ties
wording to that release.

7
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:24.911
With the CDN, a published edit
reaches new renders without

8
00:00:24.911 --> 00:00:25.874
a code deploy.

9
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.563
Use a proxy when you can't
change the site's code.

10
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.739
For content a visitor needs at once,

11
00:00:32.739 --> 00:00:35.316
&lt;Tx&gt; translates it
while the request runs.

12
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.680
Your team now ships
German with each release.
